'''Redhead Muscled Yuki Cat''' is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy that appears in [[Redhead Yuki Cat Awakens!]] She was added in [[Version 12.3 Update|Version 12.3]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Redhead Muscled Yuki Cat
|image = E 646.png
|first appearance = [[Redhead Yuki Cat Awakens!]]
|money drop = 1,500¢ - 5,925¢
}}

==Enemy==
Although she seems like quite a threat, her health is really all she has going for her. Her damage is pretty low and her freeze is short, and her [[Surge Attack]] doesn't really help with either of those two problems.

==Strategy==
As a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy, there are many counters to her. [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Sadako Cat]] can stall her easily thanks to her low damage. [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] can outrange her and deal good damage, though is likely to be hit by a Surge. [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Butterfly Cat]] and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] can be used together to rush her down once the support is dealt with, and those are only a few examples.

